        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Knock Knock, High Fidelity\n- People: Callahan, Stephen Frears\n- Topics: singles, film soundtracks\n\nFacts:\n- \"Held\" was the first single from the album \"Knock Knock.\"\n- \"Cold Blooded Old Times\" followed \"Held\" as a later single from \"Knock Knock.\"\n- \"High Fidelity\" is a 2000 American romantic comedy-drama film directed by Stephen Frears.\n- \"Cold Blooded Old Times\" later appeared on the \"High Fidelity\" film soundtrack.\n- The inclusion of \"Cold Blooded Old Times\" on the \"High Fidelity\" soundtrack attracted some attention to Callahan's work.",
